# Logo → index

On **home** experiences (Vera home card logo, Capsule header brand lockup), tapping the **logo / brand mark** must always return the user to the Project360 **index** launcher screen.

Use `popToProjectIndex` from `lib/core/navigation/project_navigation.dart` (pops the root navigator until the first route). Do not push a duplicate index or use Device Hub.

Wire new home headers the same way: `onLogoTap` on `VeraCardFace`, or `GestureDetector` on the centered brand row in shell headers.
